TG 1.0 (English)

Basic Symbols
Symbol   Meaning
K   Root

=   Identical

Opposite

&   Derivative (anything unfolded from K)

?"..."   The meaning expressed by the symbol "..."

I&   Create derivative

e=   Is

all   Anything

null   Nonexistence

unll   Existence

%   Simultaneously

Excluding

Fusion

    Root infinite

!   Counterexample of root, yet the original and counterexample hold simultaneously

✖️   ✖️ (Multiply)

0   The center of numbers, not the origin; the result of subtracting identical numbers

T   Time

S   Cannot be found

→   Unfold

Ψ   Observer

Axioms

Axiom 1 Anything is a derivative of K. &=&, &#&, K=K, K#K.

Axiom 2 unll=null, unll#null, 0=all, all=all.

