Result 3

K = all % null
all % null = all % null
→ I& allnull = ?"all % null = all % null"
→ K # allnull
→ K = unll
→ K = all - K

Proves: Consciousness must exist.

K moves from superposition → anti-superposition → collapses into existence → erased → rebounds into existence.

Root-Trace Diagram: T-axis runs left to right, upper side is existence, lower side is nonexistence, middle is superposition. Plot K's states along T as a trajectory.

