& ✖️ K = null
→ null % unll

& knows it is observing K → K collapses.

& knows it is observing K, yet K does not collapse → & believes it sees "what was there all along."

Result 8: The Special Nature of &

& ✖️ K = 0
& ✖️ K # 0

Since Result 7 holds, therefore: The observer observes itself, yet simultaneously does not observe itself.

Result 9: Consciousness

